          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/66e6d71b1f5343788be0a5b5d96583ea_l04b02-es-mejor-que-te-pruebes-la-chaqueta-azul.mp3?Expires=1794099658&Signature=yoZ6iVpaYcNMAme6KAyob90S9UyO7653Cd-deAYIOCMa84HPKbhJXifwNvSZYeCy8jc2dlsTjLeNWXoqoFXo42HJgHK1HbMEPiAsRfw76AXRrK5WNH-5SOqraebLOu5hQLGpvN5TTOyj3qomx4ctjUK3W9Bb6S9Wlb~mEX2Suv6EbI0c-kWIV8U6i-lBP2~yZQ0OociLAnIHq5kjRiJmuECkjYUAedz35TDxQ2yhS~mHlfbQOXTUYFD6-ywWBxJfsbO6voYAgka76uvxybtkp78R7lB93JMBERIpKH-HfUFjErmTj3GWXD4hrL-bjc~P-5L63VO9NfxHiWpv71EGkg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
